--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
By-reference variadic constructor parameter-pack expansion for an empty
recursion-base pack, mirroring the libstdc plus plus _Tuple_impl recursive
constructor that takes head and tail by const reference.  The empty trailing
pack expands the by-reference parameter pack to no parameters and collapses the
empty-pack base initializer, so construction succeeds.
